{"verse_key": "10:52", "surah": 10, "verse": 52, "text_uthmani": "ثُمَّ قِيلَ لِلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ ذُوقُوا۟ عَذَابَ ٱلْخُلْدِ هَلْ تُجْزَوْنَ إِلَّا بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَكْسِبُونَ", "translation": "Then it will be said to those who had wronged, \"Taste the punishment of eternity; are you being recompensed except for what you used to earn?\"", "verse_from_ms": 1209360, "verse_to_ms": 1223340, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 1209360, "end_ms": 1210610}, {"i": 1, "text": "قِيلَ", "start_ms": 1210610, "end_ms": 1211320}, {"i": 2, "text": "لِلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 1211320, "end_ms": 1212440}, {"i": 3, "text": "ظَلَمُوا۟", "start_ms": 1212440, "end_ms": 1213260}, {"i": 4, "text": "ذُوقُوا۟", "start_ms": 1213260, "end_ms": 1214060}, {"i": 5, "text": "عَذَابَ", "start_ms": 1214060, "end_ms": 1214910}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱلْخُلْدِ", "start_ms": 1214910, "end_ms": 1215820}, {"i": 7, "text": "هَلْ", "start_ms": 1215820, "end_ms": 1216220}, {"i": 8, "text": "تُجْزَوْنَ", "start_ms": 1216220, "end_ms": 1217140}, {"i": 9, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 1217140, "end_ms": 1217960}, {"i": 10, "text": "بِمَا", "start_ms": 1217960, "end_ms": 1218510}, {"i": 11, "text": "كُنتُمْ", "start_ms": 1218510, "end_ms": 1219970}, {"i": 12, "text": "تَكْسِبُونَ", "start_ms": 1219970, "end_ms": 1222865}]}